        "quote": "Except for Sections R105.2.1, R105.2.2 and R105.2.3, Section R105.2, Work exempt from permit, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "57968671-d187-5eee-af11-6bc8003f8bc7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 463,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:1",
          "start": 188
        },
        "quote": "Permits shall not be required for the following. Exemption from permit requirements of this code shall not be deemed to grant authorization for any work to be done in any manner in violation of the provisions of this code or any other laws or ordinances of this jurisdiction.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "fb771e5d-bf1b-5f39-a0be-5ff4b6820556",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 473,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:2",
          "start": 464
        },
        "quote": "Building:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "db9981ac-f8fd-5288-9d82-474cb460ef56",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 634,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:3",
          "start": 474
        },
        "quote": "1. One-story detached accessory structures used as tool and storage sheds, playhouses and similar uses, provided the floor area does not exceed 150 square feet.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "4ac7b217-9a7f-5d36-b730-7982ff195fab",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 794,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:4",
          "start": 635
        },
        "quote": "2. Retaining walls that are not over 4 feet (1,219 mm) in height measured from the bottom of the footing to the top of the wall, unless supporting a surcharge.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "fe82534f-4fbc-5266-998a-e995cf446009",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 965,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:5",
          "start": 795
        },
        "quote": "3. Water tanks supported directly upon grade if the capacity does not exceed 5,000 gallons (18,927 L) and the ratio of height to diameter or width does not exceed 2 to 1.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "ace4122b-215e-5806-bf84-f928950f2027",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1079,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:6",
          "start": 966
        },
        "quote": "4. Sidewalks and driveways not more than 30 inches above adjacent grade and not over any basement or story below.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "96345485-9136-5591-b26f-1a5c5e60d43e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1169,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:7",
          "start": 1080
        },
        "quote": "5. Painting, papering, tiling, carpeting, cabinets, counter tops and similar finish work.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "90cd25a6-4134-5b51-8111-3d05c4465eca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1245,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:8",
          "start": 1170
        },
        "quote": "6. Prefabricated swimming pools that are less than 24 inches (610 mm) deep.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "ff6e5eb0-3f3d-509b-a750-9527cee2c0b4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1329,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:9",
          "start": 1246
        },
        "quote": "7. Swings and other playground equipment accessory to a one or two family dwelling.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "8b3e020e-c2fb-559f-ae38-d3418e52f171",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1491,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:10",
          "start": 1330
        },
        "quote": "8. Window awnings supported by an exterior wall which do not project more than 54 inches (1,372 mm) from the exterior wall and do not require additional support.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "903b09a9-8d3e-53b4-ae86-a5b6de387cf6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1656,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:11",
          "start": 1492
        },
        "quote": "9. Decks not exceeding 150 square feet in area, that are not more than 30 inches (762 mm) above grade at any point, and project ten feet or less from the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.55.100 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "0ccb4a48-a50a-5ac3-95c5-159967df4a67",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1922,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:12",
          "start": 1657
        },
        "quote": "10. Ordinary repairs that are nonstructural and do not include the addition to or alteration of the existing construction. This only applies to building construction; work done to the plumbing, mechanical, or electrical areas are covered by their appropriate codes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.55.100:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
